OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy this evening with some clear
OL,7,Fspells developing early on, though
OL,8,Fcloud increasing overnight. Largely
OL,9,Fdry through the evening, but further
OL,10,Fshowers developing through the early
OL,11,Fhours. Chilly with a grass frost
OL,12,Fpossible in places.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FLargely cloudy with
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain or showers moving
OL,16,Fnorth through the day, perhaps drier
OL,17,Flater. A strengthening easterly
OL,18,Fbreeze, though temperatures around
OL,19,Fnormal for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
